This repository accompanies the manuscript
"Emotion-Associated Representations in the Feed Forward Gates of a Language Model"
by Rayan Upadhyay and Sankar Balasubramanian.

The manuscript states that the materials are released under CC-BY-4.0.
You may share and adapt the material for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct weights are downloaded from Hugging Face and remain
under that model's licence. The NRC Emotion Lexicon is used through the
installed nrclex 4.1.0 package and is not redistributed in this repository.
